id: pm-memory-recall-federation
title: Federate recall across explicitly selected trackers
description: "Explore bounded recall across explicitly named trackers, with per-source completeness and consent enforced."
type: Feature
status: open
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-11-19T06:08:33.597Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-20T02:37:03.525Z"
author: codex-sol
acceptance_criteria: "An agent can distinguish omitted, unavailable and ineligible sources without silently crossing tracker boundaries."
parent: pm-memory-0kwy
comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-20T00:53:14.062Z",codex-sol,"Design: explicit tracker selectors form the entire federated read set. Each selector can name its own native task ID and must be individually opted in. Standalone certified SDK reads feed a shared whole-row budget and source receipts. Existing consent-managed records remain under the purpose-limited view workflow. The no-selector resume path retains its existing output."
  "2026-11-20T01:02:49.565Z",codex-sol,"Measured public scratch copies at pm-memory 1423ca6 and pm-context 41f3acc with pm core 2026.11.14. TOON baseline 93 + 97 + 552 orientation = 742 tokens, federation 161, saving 581 (78.3%). JSON baseline 147 + 151 + 951 orientation = 1249, federation 294, saving 955 (76.5%). Both paths supplied the same two full actionable rows. The single-tracker CLI output matched the original bytes in both formats on both tasks."
  "2026-11-20T01:07:53.704Z",codex-sol,"SDK source preflight validates native settings, schema and item format versions. The real tracker fixtures cover opt-in, scoped and legacy privacy withholding, absent and unreadable sources, incompatible formats, source-attributed rows, whole and partial budget omissions, and unchanged history. Typecheck, lint, docstring and duplication gates passed."
  "2026-11-20T01:28:36.035Z",codex-sol,"Implementation commit ee786fb. The focused native CLI and SDK suite passed 12/12, and packed npm and Bun acceptance passed 4/4. Strict tracker health passed with a clean global extension directory. The pre-existing local pm-github host skew is tracked by pm-memory-ci-health-skew. Tracker privacy and commit identity scans passed. Package-wide coverage is running."
  "2026-11-20T02:36:51.006Z",codex-sol,"Package-wide quick gate passed 923/923 with zero skips. All 41 source files met 100% statements, branches, functions and lines. This includes every test file referencing the touched entry point, source modules or README. Production dependency audit found zero vulnerabilities."
  "2026-11-20T02:37:02.047Z",codex-sol,"Changelog verification passed after fetching tags and regenerating with the feature returned to open. The tracker diff contains the linked files, README example and direct test commands."
